WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Low Lunge, walk both hands inside the front foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lower the back knee if needed.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Twist toward the front leg and stack or reach the top arm.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the hips heavy.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
